Recommends: btrfs-progs, libvirt-clients
Description: GTK4 manager for btrfs subvolume snapshots
 A small libadwaita GUI for creating, listing and deleting btrfs snapshots
 of selected subvolumes, with one snapshot folder per subvolume. It does not
 use Snapper and does not impose a layout.
 .
 The GUI runs as the user. Every operation goes through pkexec to one of
 three small root helpers, each with its own polkit action. The helpers only
 accept volume names from root-owned configuration in /etc/btrfs-snapman.
